		(property "Note" "Operator-sourced and fitted, as on HAT rev 2.1 (S13.5.6). Every pin passes through to the HAT; PWR touches only the ones with nets. GPIO27 (pin 13) = MCU BOOT0, GPIO24 (pin 18) = MCU reset, GPIO6 (pin 31) = power fail. GPIO24 is free on rev 2.1 (PWR supports rev 2.1 and later)."
			(at 38.1 63.5 0)
			(show_name no)
